-- Hosbah: one row per server (MH-580 J2) holding fail2ban's sshd jail settings. Installing and
-- applying fail2ban itself is an operation (fail2ban.install, internal/agent/fail2ban.go); this row
-- is only the team's desired settings, applied on install and on every settings change.
